# Bulk data + generated artifacts — bind-mounted from host at runtime,
# never baked into the image (would be 6+ GB and uncacheable).
corpus/
data/
log/

# Local dev cruft
.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store

# IDE / tooling
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Reference material excluded from version control
*.pdf

# Cached TLS material — regenerated on first run if needed
.incommon_intermediate.pem

# Docs that don't need to ship in the image
# (prompt/ is INTENTIONALLY NOT in this list: prompt/AGENT_PROMPT.md
# and prompt/SUMERIAN_GRAMMAR.md are read at runtime by the
# oracc://prompt/agent + oracc://grammar/sumerian MCP resources AND
# by the start_here() / get_grammar_reference() tool wrappers.
# Excluding them produces silent bootstrap failures: the tools return
# a "# prompt/AGENT_PROMPT.md missing" placeholder instead of the real
# system prompt, and the agent never gets its workflow guidance.
# Two markdown files total ~26 KB — trivial image-size impact.)
README.md
CLAUDE.md
CONTINUATION.md
